  "daily_overview": "今日全球局势迎来深刻变革：科技领域，英伟达斥资 130 亿美元收购 Hugging Face，同时 AI 自进化进程加速，Claude 已开始自主训练下一代模型。财经与政经交织，特朗普宣布美委达成掌控 650 亿桶石油的「历史性协议」，而中国光伏巨头隆基绿能亏损加剧则折射出清洁能源行业洗牌。时政方面，霍尔木兹海峡局势持续紧绷，国际地缘政治的博弈正重塑能源与供应链版图。\n\nToday marks deep shifts globally. In tech, NVIDIA acquires Hugging Face for $13B while AI self-evolution accelerates as Claude begins training itself. In finance and geopolitics, Trump hails a historic deal to control 65B barrels of Venezuelan oil, while Longi Green Energy's deepening loss underscores solar industry consolidation. Politically, Strait of Hormuz tensions persist, showing how geopolitical games are reshaping global energy and supply chains.",
